  "title": "rpm packaging: Move unversioned shared library files to -devel package",
  "description": "The unversioned shared library files (just symbolic links)\nlike libwireshark.so, libwiretap.so, and libwsutil.so\nbelong in the -devel package. They're only necessary for linking\nwhen compiling, and not for running the program. This doesn't\nmake a tremendous amount of difference in our typical use case,\nbut makes it somewhat easier to have multiple versions installed.\n\nSee also:\nhttps://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/packaging-guidelines/#_devel_packages",
